GUI:OptionsGroupLanguage
"Language"
END

GUI:Language
"Text Language"
END

GUI:Language0
"English"
END

GUI:Language1
"Türkçe"
END

GUI:Language2
"Deutsch"
END

GUI:Language3
"Українська"
END

GUI:Language4
"Русский"
END

GUI:Language5
"Français"
END

TOOLTIP:Language
"The language of menus, orders, briefings and subtitles. Voices and videos stay as installed. Takes effect the next time the game starts."
END

// The line under it when the lobby's Pile Limit has the pile closed to the player looking at it.

TOOLTIP:SupplyPileFull
"\n Taken: the pile limit keeps your gatherers out"
