"No Limit"
END

GUI:SupplyPileLimitFormat
"%d per pile"
END

GUI:ProRules
"Pro Rules"
END

TOOLTIP:ProRules
"The tournament list. No Particle Cannon or SCUD Storm, except the Superweapon General's one cannon. The Nuclear Missile silo goes up but never fires. No Aurora, no Tactical Nuke MiGs, no demo bike, no suicide bombs, Neutron Shells or Stealth Comanche, and no Carpet Bomb before rank 3. A Microwave Tank cannot freeze a building still going up, nobody builds within 300 of an enemy building, and nobody puts more than two Patriots, Gatling Cannons or Stinger Sites round one group of oil derricks."
END

GUI:TurboMode
"Turbo Mode"
END

TOOLTIP:TurboMode
"The match runs twice as fast: two seconds of play go by in every second, and nothing else about it changes. In a network game the host picks it for everyone."
END

GUI:TurboModeMissions
"Turbo Mode in Missions"
END

TOOLTIP:TurboModeMissions
"Campaign and Generals' Challenge missions run twice as fast, and a mission already under way speeds up at once. Skirmish and multiplayer games have their own box in the lobby."
END

