"Your camera movements are recorded into your replays of single player and skirmish games."
END

GUI:UseCamera
"Follow Recorded Camera"
END

TOOLTIP:UseCamera
"A replay follows the camera its player recorded instead of leaving you a free camera."
END

GUI:DrawScrollAnchor
