// What each personality does, shown when the pointer is over the box or a line of its list
GUI:AIPersonaTooltipNormal
"Plays exactly as the computer always has."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipAttacker
"Attacks early and often with smaller waves, spends its money as fast as it comes in and builds few defences."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipTurtle
"Puts up a defence line early and guns at the chokepoints, attacks late with big waves and pulls back sooner when it is losing."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipEconomist
"Income and upgrades first, a later first attack, and its spare money goes to the poorest ally."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipAir
"Builds airfields and sends its aircraft out on sorties, and turns away from them when your anti-air is heavy."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipRusher
"Throws everything into one attack, three minutes in on Hard and four and a half on Easy, with almost no defences. After it, it plays as an Attacker."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipRaider
"Sends small groups of its fastest vehicles around your army at your gatherers and workers, from the third minute on Hard and the fifth on Easy."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipTech
"Sits behind its defences and races to the superweapon, then plays as the normal computer once it stands. Turns its powers on whoever hits an ally."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipInfantry
"An infantry army trained from its barracks first, with its waves carried in transports."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipArmor
"A tank-heavy army that waits longer to gather and attacks in fewer, bigger waves."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipSneaky
"Favours units that turn invisible, spends its general's points on stealth first and comes in by the flanks and the back door."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipOpportunist
"Goes after the weakest enemy in sight, and after whoever is already fighting someone else."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipSupporter
"Joins its allies' attacks and sends its idle army to clear enemies out of an ally's base."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipCounter
"Reads your army harder and builds what beats it, even on Easy."
END

GUI:AIPersonaTooltipRandom
"One of the personalities above, drawn when the match starts. Never Normal."
END

GUI:AIPersona
"Personality"
END

